Heres come context on each species:

Master Profile Catalog

Alpha Draconians
Classification: Reptilian Apex
Physicality: 7–14 feet tall; leathery wings; horned heads; scaled skin.
Core Lore: The imperial leaders of hostile reptilian factions; linked to ancient genetic manipulation.

Andromedans
Classification: Humanoid (Higher Density)
Physicality: 6+ feet tall; light blue/translucent skin; hairless; silver eyes.
Core Lore: Advanced masters of sacred geometry and science; act as cosmic peacekeepers.

Ant People (Anu Sinom)
Classification: Cryptoterrestrial Insectoid
Physicality: Slender; segmented insectoid bodies; large black eyes; antennae.
Core Lore: Hopi tribal mythology; sheltered humans in subterranean caves during past cataclysms.

Anunnaki
Classification: Ancient Humanoid Group
Physicality: Giant humanoids; historically depicted in ancient Mesopotamian art styles.
Core Lore: Sitchin mythology; originated from planet Nibiru; engineered modern humans to mine gold.

Arcturans
Classification: Energetic / Etheric
Physicality: Frequently formless; described as pure, vibrant geometric light energy.
Core Lore: Highly spiritual, benevolent guides guarding the galaxy's ascension pathways.

Bellatricians
Classification: Cybernetic Reptoid Hybrid
Physicality: Phosphorescent scaled skin; unique, reinforced skeletal structures.
Core Lore: Bellatrix system outcasts who broke away from tyrannies to join peaceful federations.

Blue Avians
Classification: Avian (Higher Density)
Physicality: 8 feet tall; covered in vibrant blue feathers; flexible, non-beaked avian faces.
Core Lore: Modern whistleblower lore; promote spiritual awakening through non-violent telepathy.

Cassiopaeans
Classification: Future/Disembodied Consciousness
Physicality: Lacks physical bodies; exist as 6th-density conscious light.
Core Lore: 1990s channeling lore; future human iterations offering cryptographic cosmic advice.

Centaurians
Classification: Humanoid
Physicality: Flawless human symmetry; athletic builds; faintly luminescent skin.
Core Lore: Advanced Alpha Centauri scientists attempting to guide Earth toward clean eco-energy.

Ebens
Classification: Humanoid / Grey Variant
Physicality: 4 feet tall; large hairless heads; gray-brown skin; large black eyes.
Core Lore: Central to "Project Serpo"; allegedly ran a military exchange program with the US in 1965.

Essassani
Classification: Hybrid Humanoid
Physicality: 5 feet tall; pale skin; enlarged heads; large dark eyes.
Core Lore: Bashar channeling lore; a telepathic, currency-free civilization operating as spiritual mentors.

Greys (Zeta Reticulans)
Classification: Humanoid / Archetype
Physicality: 3.5–4.5 feet tall; large bulbous heads; gray skin; oversized black almond eyes.
Core Lore: The standard modern abduction archetype; associated with the 1947 Roswell event.

Insectoids (Mantis Beings)
Classification: Insectoid Archetype
Physicality: Bipedal praying mantis structure; segmented limbs; large compound eyes.
Core Lore: Often reported acting in supervisory roles over Greys during medical abductions.

Lyrans (Humanoid Subtype)
Classification: Humanoid / Root Stock
Physicality: Tall; fair skin; Caucasian facial structures; majestic features.
Core Lore: The original "galactic humans" whose civilization was destroyed in ancient star wars.

Lyrans (Feline/Urmah Subtype)
Classification: Feloid Hybrid
Physicality: Bipedal; lion or tiger facial structures; dense muscular frames.
Core Lore: Starseed lore; fierce, proud spiritual warriors acting as protectors of free systems.

Mantindae
Classification: Advanced Insectoid
Physicality: Up to 9 feet tall; translucent exoskeletons; long, raptorial forelimbs.
Core Lore: Deep abduction accounts; cold, hyper-scientific genetic masterminds lacking human emotion.

Nommo
Classification: Amphibious Humanoid
Physicality: Smooth, sleek skin; webbed hands and feet; fish-like bodies.
Core Lore: Dogon tribal lore; visited Earth from Sirius; gifted precise astronomical knowledge.

Nordics (Pleiadians)
Classification: Humanoid / Archetype
Physicality: Physically striking; blonde hair; blue eyes; indistinguishable from tall humans.
Core Lore: 1950s contactee lore; peaceful, highly evolved beings warning humans about nuclear tech.

Orion Collective
Classification: Multi-species Syndicate
Physicality: Highly varied; includes tall "Dark Greys", cybernetic humanoids, and reptilians.
Core Lore: Associated with the ancient, galactic "Orion Wars" between empire builders and rebels.

Procyonians
Classification: Humanoid
Physicality: Muscular frames; vibrant, golden-hued skin; piercing, intense eyes.
Core Lore: Actively expose cloaking and psychological manipulation tech used by hostile factions.

Reptilians (Reptoids)
Classification: Reptilian / Archetype
Physicality: 6–8 feet tall; green-brown scales; muscular build; slit pupils.
Core Lore: Conspiracy theory staples; allegedly manipulate human politics from subterranean bases.

Shadow Beings
Classification: Interdimensional / Formless
Physicality: Ink-black human silhouettes; devoid of features; sometimes wear wide brims.
Core Lore: Straddles paranormal and UFO lore; seen during sleep paralysis as observers.

Sirians
Classification: Diverse Galactic Strain
Physicality: Humanoid, aquatic, or etheric depending on the Sirius sub-system.
Core Lore: Deeply linked to the spiritual and architectural evolution of ancient Egypt.

Tall Whites
Classification: Humanoid Variant
Physicality: 7+ feet tall; chalk-white skin; white hair; large, striking blue eyes.
Core Lore: Charles Hall military testimonies; allegedly lived on US Air Force bases under treaty.

Tau Cetians
Classification: Humanoid
Physicality: Stocky, dense skeletal build; weathered or dark skin; stoic features.
Core Lore: Fiercely independent humanoids actively fighting Grey and Reptilian subversion.

Telosians (Agarthans)
Classification: Cryptoterrestrial Humanoid
Physicality: Identical to Nordics; tall, fair-haired, radiating athletic health.
Core Lore: Survivors of Lemuria living inside a hollow earth network beneath Mount Shasta.

Vegans
Classification: Humanoid / Lyran Offshoot
Physicality: Copper or dark skin tones; sharp facial geometry; large, deep dark eyes.
Core Lore: Split from mainstream Lyrans to pursue paths of complete pacifism and meditation.

Venusians
Classification: Humanoid / Historic
Physicality: Beautiful human aesthetics; long blonde hair; radiant aura.
Core Lore: George Adamski's 1950s accounts; lived on a higher-dimensional frequency of Venus.

Yahyel (Shalanaya)
Classification: Human-Grey Hybrid
Physicality: Glowing skin; highly expressive eyes; soft, symmetrical facial structures.
Core Lore: Chosen by modern contactees as the race destined to make overt "First Contact."

The Ummites
Classification: Humanoid (Nordic Variant)
Physicality: Tall, Scandinavian appearance, completely indistinguishable from Earth humans.
Core Lore: Originating from the alleged planet "Ummo" (orbiting the star Wolf 424), this group is famous for a massive series of highly technical letters and documents sent to Spanish UFO researchers from the 1960s to the 1990s. The documents contained complex scientific equations and detailed descriptions of their sociology, though it was later largely exposed as an elaborate, decades-long psychological hoax.2.

The Dracos (Draconians)
Classification: Reptilian ElitePhysicality: Distinct from basic Reptoids; they stand 8 to 12 feet tall, possess a rigid white or black scaled hide, distinct webbed wings/paddles on their backs, and prominent horns.
Core Lore: Central to deep global conspiracy lore. They are characterized as the absolute monarchical rulers of the Reptilian imperial hierarchy. Lore claims they view Earth as an ancient genetic farm and operate via shadow infiltration of human geopolitical systems.3.

Ashtar Command (The Ashtarians)
Classification: Multi-Dimensional Federation / Etheric
Physicality: Varies; usually manifests as glowing, flawless humanoid beings dressed in futuristic military jumpsuits.
Core Lore: Originating from 1950s contactee George Van Tassel, this is a literal space-born military-spiritual coalition led by a Christ-like alien figure named "Ashtar." New Age lore positions them as a massive fleet of starships parked invisibly in Earth’s orbit to protect the planet from nuclear destruction or hostile timelines.4.

The Sirian Blue-Skins
Classification: Humanoid Offshoot
Physicality: Human-proportioned bodies but with deep sapphire, indigo, or translucent blue skin tones.
Core Lore: A subset of Sirian lore popularized in "Starseed" groups. They are described as ancient keepers of spiritual geometry and technology who allegedly interacted with early civilizations in Egypt, India, and Mesoamerica, inspiring myths of blue-skinned deities (such as certain depictions of Hindu gods).5.

The K-Group (Kondrosians)
Classification: Humanoid / Synthetic Hybrid
Physicality: Pale green or chalky skin, prominent brow ridges, and highly analytical, emotionless expressions.
Core Lore: Emerging from alleged leaked top-secret US intelligence documents (such as the "Matrix" papers compiled by Val Valerian in the early 1990s), this race is described as a highly technical group that covertly monitors Earth’s nuclear facilities, operating as independent information brokers between benevolent and hostile factions.6.

The Orange (Orangoid)
Classification: Humanoid-Reptoid Hybrid
Physicality: Humanoid stance, distinct red-orange hair, and pale skin with underlying, subtle yellowish or orange reptilian scaling.
Core Lore: Found extensively in "Dulce Base" and underground facility folklore. Whistleblower lore (such as testimonies from Thomas Castello) claims "The Orange" are an artificially engineered hybrid workforce created to bridge communications between human shadow-government scientists and deeper subterranean Reptilian factions.7.

The Pleiadian Renegades
Classification: Humanoid Split
Physicality: Indistinguishable from Nordics but often described as having darker hair (brunette/black) and a more intense, brooding, or militaristic presence.
Core Lore: Unlike the main Pleiadian collective—which is characterized as fiercely pacifistic—the "Renegades" are a breakaway faction in modern channeling lore. They are described as chaotic-neutral actors who actively break galactic non-interference laws to directly intervene in Earth's history, giving humans rogue technologies or occult knowledge.8.

The Iargans
Classification: Amphibious-Mammalian Hybrid
Physicality: Stocky, muscular humanoids with wide, flat faces, slightly webbed digits, and large, deeply set dark eyes adapted for low-light/aquatic conditions.
Core Lore: Extracted from the 1969 case of Stefan Denaerde, a Dutch industrialist who claimed to have rescued an alien craft in the Oosterschelde. The beings allegedly from "Iarga" shared a deeply structured, hyper-socialist, and ecologically flawless societal blueprint, which forms a cornerstone of European techno-utopian UFO literature.9.

The Clarions
Classification: Humanoid (Historic Contactee)
Physicality: Human-sized, physically attractive, with dark hair, tan skin, and slightly elongated eyes.
Core Lore: Popularized by 1950s contactee Truman Bethurum, who claimed he was repeatedly visited by a woman named Aura Rhanes, the captain of a spaceship from the planet Clarion. Notably, Clarion was claimed to be a planet hidden directly behind Earth's moon—a classic example of pre-spaceflight UFO mythology.10.

The Chitauri
Classification: African Reptilian Folklore
Physicality: Tall, shape-shifting reptilian humanoids with large heads and cold, lidless eyes.
Core Lore: Brought into modern ufology by Zulu shaman and historian Credo Mutwa. He claimed that traditional African lore explicitly documents the Chitauri ("the dictators/the talkers") as an ancient alien race that enslaved humanity, stripped them of their telepathic powers, and forced humans into a paradigm of language, labor, and division.11.

The Cetians (Alpha Centauri B Humanoids)
Classification: Humanoid Archetype
Physicality: Slightly shorter than Earth humans, highly dense bone structure, dark bronze or weathered skin, and very dark hair.
Core Lore: Frequently mentioned alongside Tau Cetians, these beings are characterized as highly practical, blue-collar cosmic survivalists. In modern whistleblower accounts, they are described as a deeply defensive race that strictly avoids the spiritual "ascension" rhetoric of the Pleiadians, focusing instead on hard defense systems against Grey abduction networks.